This strategy refers to the integration of resources monitors into evryday objects in order to measure and resources usage in real time. Through a better communication between users and products, it is possible to reduce the resources consumtion based on information gathered via them. For this strategy designers can work on (Flattau):

(1) making energy “visible” to consumers; 
(2) using the complete spectrum of consumer data facilities, such as points of usage and portable phones, to track energy consumption
(3) push software development limits through participatory research.